1
00:00:00,405 --> 00:00:01,925
Welcome to the Fishing Hole.

2
00:00:02,225 --> 00:00:05,765
I'm Natalie, and it's my great pleasure to be your server this evening.

3
00:00:06,325 --> 00:00:12,520
I know that you've got your menus already, but I'd like to give you this little flyer featuring the specials of the day.

4
00:00:13,105 --> 00:00:17,085
You can see that it has four dishes on it, all of which are outstanding.

5
00:00:17,785 --> 00:00:23,385
However, if you ask me, the baked rainbow trout is the best of those four items.

6
00:00:23,985 --> 00:00:25,810
You can't go wrong ordering it.

7
00:00:26,405 --> 00:00:32,465
I'll be back with some bread in a moment, but if you're ready to order drinks, I can take your order right now.
